# calculate_molecular_fraction_BR06 called directly (R/src/model_h2_chemistry.c:117-125): the stellar scale height (:48-60) and the pressure-based fraction (:68-101).
# The arguments the radial integration passes for annulus 0 of a Snap_32 central (radial_r2_snap32_central):
# its sigma_gas_r and sigma_star_r and the galaxy's rs_pc, as oracle_c08 records them for that
# fixture, whose galaxy takes a real galaxy's values from the R2 reference /Volumes/Internal/results/sage26-campaign/workspace/e01-reference/out/R2/model_0.hdf5
# (SHA-256 c6af6c9385d41adcccbd5f19e064323486706b0965183f61ebded290331f6714).
# On R2 the public routine itself is not called (only the single-slab branch, S:235, and other prescriptions call it); its core is what the radial integration calls per annulus.
# Reachability: R2-reachable (as the annulus call).
format sage26-oracle-fixture 1
routine calculate_molecular_fraction_BR06

f32 call.gas_surface_density_msun_pc2 0x437531dc  # 245.194763  (sigma_gas_r, Msun/pc^2)
f32 call.stellar_surface_density_msun_pc2 0x410c6f3c  # 8.77715683  (sigma_star_r, Msun/pc^2)
f32 call.disk_scale_length_pc 0x4499c3c4  # 1230.11768  (rs_pc, pc)
